it for a month. Then my college started and I couldn't do much for 3-4
months. I resumed again in May.

To be fair, I don't know a lot of Lojban words. I have to look up
every third word when I read others' writing. I use jbovlaste and
jbofi'e a lot while writing.

Thanks for the encouragement.
Anand

